+# DreamAvatar v0.3.1 · Slot Alignment + Standalone AddOn
+
+## Fixed
+
+- Corrects Turtle WoW player visible-item base from `0x03C8` to `0x03F8`.
+- The previous base was exactly one 0x30-byte visible-item block early:
+  - the UI main-hand row read the previous equipment block;
+  - the UI off-hand row followed the real main hand;
+  - the UI ranged row followed the real off hand;
+  - enchant glow main/off writes were shifted by the same amount.
+- Keeps logical inventory slot mapping 16/17/18 for main/off/ranged.
+- Clears stale v0.3 weapon/glow saved inputs once through layout version 2.
+- Renames weapon inputs to weapon display ID / ItemDisplayInfo ID.
+
+## Standalone AddOn loading
+
+- Removes `## RequiredDeps: MoonMarker` from DreamAvatar.toc.
+- DreamAvatar can load without the MoonMarker AddOn folder.
+- Guild authorization remains mandatory and is still enforced twice:
+  - Lua calls `MMAuth` before every operation;
+  - the DLL calls `moonMarkerGuildAuth::isAuthorized()` for every DreamAvatar native command.
+- The authorization implementation remains compiled into `UnitXP_SP3.dll`; no fallback that bypasses authorization was added.
+
+## Preserved
+
+- Character model native rebuild path at `0x0060ABE0`.
+- MoonMarker beam/main-model/runtime/auth source files unchanged.
+- No unit Disable/Enable sequence.
+- No new hook.
